1
00:00:00,230 --> 00:00:03,130
This toy has fascinated me since childhood.

2
00:00:03,130 --> 00:00:05,100
To me its motion is almost hypnotic.

3
00:00:05,100 --> 00:00:06,980
Here's how it operates.

4
00:00:06,980 --> 00:00:11,280
Wet the bird's beak thoroughly with room
temperature water — the opaque container

5
00:00:11,280 --> 00:00:16,230
makes it look chilled, but it isn't ... then
stand it upright ... It'll take a few

6
00:00:16,230 --> 00:00:20,859
seconds for it to start drinking ... Notice
that all of the action right now takes place

7
00:00:20,859 --> 00:00:22,829
in the stem here.
